---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="RM Performance — Meta Ads with payment per enquiry | RM CREATIVES" description="Patient acquisition through Meta Ads for medical clinics and beauty studios. Pay for agreed qualified enquiries, not a monthly management retainer.">
<main class="copy-page product-page">
<section class="hero shell"><div class="eyebrow top"><span>RM / PRODUCT 01</span><span>META ADS / HUMAN + AI</span></div><div class="hero-grid"><div><h1>Pay for enquiries. Not <span class="whole-word">ad-management</span> hours.</h1></div><aside><p>Meta Ads for clinics with payment per enquiry. A specialist owns strategy and creative direction; AI compares campaigns, offers and lead quality to guide the next test.</p><a href="/contact">Enquiry cost ↗</a></aside></div></section>
<section class="statement"><div class="shell statement-grid"><span class="eyebrow">THE MODEL</span><h2>You do not buy our time. You buy a measurable acquisition outcome.</h2><p>Before launch, we define the service, market, enquiry and commercial model. Strategy, campaign management, creative testing, optimisation and measurement remain on our side. The clinic pays against the agreed enquiry model rather than a vague list of hours.</p></div></section>
<section class="compare shell"><div class="old"><span class="eyebrow">THE USUAL MODEL</span><h3>Pay every month.</h3><div class="rows"><p><span>Agency retainer</span><b>€ / MONTH</b></p><p><span>Campaign setup</span><b>+</b></p><p><span>Creative testing</span><b>+</b></p><p><span>Result</span><b>?</b></p></div><small>You pay for the work even when the campaigns do not produce enough enquiries.</small></div><div class="new"><span class="eyebrow">RM PERFORMANCE</span><h3>Pay for enquiries.</h3><div class="formula"><span>50</span><i>ENQUIRIES</i><b>×</b><span>€X</span><i>AGREED PRICE</i></div><div class="equals"><span>=</span><strong>ONE CLEAR<br/>COMMERCIAL MODEL</strong></div><small>Meta produces a large stream of signals: creative, audience, placement, offer, cost, frequency, lead form and lead outcome. AI helps us organise and compare those signals continuously. The specialist uses that analysis to decide which ideas deserve more budget, which are fatiguing and which are producing cheap but weak enquiries.</small></div></section>
<section class="responsibility"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">WHO CONTROLS WHAT</span><h2>A clean line of<br/>responsibility.</h2></div><div class="split"><div><span class="eyebrow">RM CREATIVES</span><h3>We are responsible for getting the enquiry.</h3><p>We own strategy, creative direction, campaign structure, testing, optimisation and enquiry tracking. AI extends our analysis; it does not remove human review.</p></div><div><span class="eyebrow">YOUR CLINIC</span><h3>You are responsible for what happens after it.</h3><p>You own response speed, patient communication, availability, booking conversion and patient experience. Where possible, those outcomes are returned to the acquisition system so we optimise for better enquiries, not only more forms.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="flow shell"><span class="eyebrow">HOW IT WORKS</span><div class="steps"><div><b>01</b><h3>Specialist hypothesis</h3><p>Specialist defines the service, audience hypothesis, offer and creative angle.</p></div><div><b>02</b><h3>Campaign data</h3><p>Campaigns generate response data.</p></div><div><b>03</b><h3>AI-assisted analysis</h3><p>AI-assisted analysis compares cost, volume, creative patterns and available lead-quality feedback.</p></div><div><b>04</b><h3>Human decision &amp; next test</h3><p>Specialist decides what to stop, change, expand or test next. The next test is informed by the full history, not only the latest screenshot.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="proof"><div class="shell proof-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">REAL WORK / META ADS</span><h2>The model is built on years of clinic acquisition.</h2><a href="/cases">See all Meta Ads cases ↗</a></div><div class="metric"><strong>2,970</strong><span>EPILINE · META ENQUIRIES<br/>JAN–AUG 2026</span></div><div class="metric"><strong>1,902</strong><span>DENTA · META ENQUIRIES<br/>JAN–AUG 2026</span></div><div class="metric"><strong>€2.75</strong><span>UNION KLINIKA<br/>WEIGHTED CPL · MAY–DEC 2024</span></div></div></section>
<section class="not"><div class="shell not-grid"><span class="eyebrow">IMPORTANT</span><h2>We sell enquiries.<br/>Not patients.</h2><p>We sell and optimise enquiries. We do not call every enquiry a patient. The clinic’s follow-up and clinical capacity still determine what happens after the lead arrives.</p></div></section>
<section class="cta shell"><span class="eyebrow">RM PERFORMANCE</span><h2>How much could an enquiry cost for your clinic?</h2><p>Share the services, locations and current lead data. We will assess whether the outcome-led model is realistic and where AI-assisted testing can improve the learning speed.</p><a href="/contact">Enquiry cost ↗</a></section>
<section class="related shell"><div class="related-head"><span class="eyebrow">RELATED CASES / META ADS</span><h2>See how Meta Ads performs in real clinic projects.</h2></div><div class="case-cards"><a href="/cases/epiline/meta-ads"><span class="eyebrow">EPILINE / META ADS</span><h3>Scale volume without losing control of CPL.</h3><strong>2,970</strong><p>Meta enquiries · Jan–Aug 2026</p><b>READ CASE ↗</b></a><a href="/cases/denta/meta-ads"><span class="eyebrow">DENTA / META ADS</span><h3>Build a predictable paid social channel for dentistry.</h3><strong>1,902</strong><p>Meta enquiries · Jan–Aug 2026</p><b>READ CASE ↗</b></a><a href="/cases/union-klinika/meta-ads"><span class="eyebrow">UNION KLINIKA / META ADS</span><h3>Patient acquisition with a limited marketing budget.</h3><strong>€2.75</strong><p>Weighted CPL · May–Dec 2024</p><b>READ CASE ↗</b></a><a href="/cases/consilium-medicum/meta-ads"><span class="eyebrow">CONSILIUM MEDICUM / META ADS</span><h3>Create patient demand beyond Google Search.</h3><strong>META</strong><p>Paid social for medical services</p><b>READ CASE ↗</b></a></div></section>
</main>
</BaseLayout>
